---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="How I build, Prakash Upadhyay" description="How Prakash Upadhyay builds software with AI agents, and where the human stays in the loop." current="how-i-build" hand>
<section aria-labelledby="page-title" style="position: relative; overflow: hidden; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); background: radial-gradient(900px 520px at 22% 30%, var(--hero-glow) 0%, var(--hero-mid) 55%, var(--bg) 100%)">
<div style="position: relative; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 72px clamp(16px, 4vw, 40px) 80px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px">
<h1 id="page-title" style="margin: 0; color: var(--accent); font-size: clamp(48px, 7vw, 96px); font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.035em; line-height: 0.98">How I build</h1>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: clamp(22px, 2.6vw, 30px); font-weight: 300; color: var(--text-muted)">Agents do the work. I make the calls.</p>
<p style="margin: 0; max-width: 720px; font-size: 19px; text-wrap: pretty">I build my products, tools and content with AI agents: mostly Claude, in Claude Code on my machine and through the Claude API inside apps, with other tools when a task needs them. This is the loop I follow, and the points where I stay in charge.</p>
</div>
</section>

<main>
<section aria-labelledby="loop-title" style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 96px clamp(16px, 4vw, 40px) 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 48px 72px">
<figure class="loop" style="flex: 1 1 520px; min-width: 0; margin: 0" data-loop>
<svg viewBox="-70 0 740 600" width="100%" role="group" aria-label="A hand-drawn loop of eight stages: Research, Spec, Design, Build, Review, Ship, Share and Reuse, then back to Research. Agents do the work at every stage. Square markers show the four human gates, at Research, Spec, Review and Ship. In the middle: Human in the loop. Each stage name links to its details below." style="display: block; max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto; overflow: visible">
<path d="M 300 80 C 422 78, 522 180, 520 300 C 518 424, 420 522, 300 520 C 176 521, 79 420, 80 300 C 82 178, 180 81, 304 82" fill="none" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="1500" class="loop-draw"></path>
<path d="M 297 85 C 420 83, 516 183, 515 302 C 513 420, 417 516, 298 515 C 179 515, 85 418, 86 298 C 87 181, 183 86, 299 87" fill="none" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-opacity="0.35" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="1500" class="loop-draw"></path>
<path d="M 222.4 104.4 L 233.3 92.6 L 217.5 89.2" fill="none" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"></path>
<rect x="291" y="71" width="18" height="18" fill="var(--accent)"></rect>
<rect x="446.6" y="135.4" width="18" height="18" fill="var(--accent)" transform="rotate(4 455.6 144.4)"></rect>
<circle cx="520" cy="300" r="9" fill="var(--bg)" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="1.6"></circle>
<circle cx="455.6" cy="455.6" r="9" fill="var(--bg)" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="1.6"></circle>
<rect x="291" y="511" width="18" height="18" fill="var(--accent)" transform="rotate(-3 300 520)"></rect>
<rect x="135.4" y="446.6" width="18" height="18" fill="var(--accent)" transform="rotate(5 144.4 455.6)"></rect>
<circle cx="80" cy="300" r="9" fill="var(--bg)" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="1.6"></circle>
<circle cx="144.4" cy="144.4" r="9" fill="var(--bg)" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="1.6"></circle>
<g fill="var(--ink)" style="font-family: var(--font-hand); font-size: 30px; font-weight: 600">
<a class="loop-stage" href="#stage-research" data-tip="Human gate. I decide: Whether the idea is worth building at all." aria-label="Research, human gate: Whether the idea is worth building at all. Go to the Research stage."><path class="loop-stage__splash" d=""></path><text x="300" y="50" text-anchor="middle">Research</text></a>
<a class="loop-stage" href="#stage-spec" data-tip="Human gate. I decide: Approve the spec before any code is written." aria-label="Spec, human gate: Approve the spec before any code is written. Go to the Spec stage."><path class="loop-stage__splash" d=""></path><text x="482" y="122" text-anchor="start">Spec</text></a>
<a class="loop-stage" href="#stage-design" data-tip="Agents. I decide: Pick the direction and cut what doesn’t belong." aria-label="Design, agents: Pick the direction and cut what doesn’t belong. Go to the Design stage."><path class="loop-stage__splash" d=""></path><text x="550" y="309" text-anchor="start">Design</text></a>
<a class="loop-stage" href="#stage-build" data-tip="Agents. I decide: Architecture, boundaries and what the agent may touch." aria-label="Build, agents: Architecture, boundaries and what the agent may touch. Go to the Build stage."><path class="loop-stage__splash" d=""></path><text x="482" y="498" text-anchor="start">Build</text></a>
<a class="loop-stage" href="#stage-review" data-tip="Human gate. I decide: Read every diff, then try the real thing myself." aria-label="Review, human gate: Read every diff, then try the real thing myself. Go to the Review stage."><path class="loop-stage__splash" d=""></path><text x="300" y="568" text-anchor="middle">Review</text></a>
<a class="loop-stage" href="#stage-ship" data-tip="Human gate. I decide: Press the button. Nothing deploys or posts without a yes." aria-label="Ship, human gate: Press the button. Nothing deploys or posts without a yes. Go to the Ship stage."><path class="loop-stage__splash" d=""></path><text x="118" y="498" text-anchor="end">Ship</text></a>
<a class="loop-stage" href="#stage-share" data-tip="Agents. I decide: The voice, the facts and what is ready to go public." aria-label="Share, agents: The voice, the facts and what is ready to go public. Go to the Share stage."><path class="loop-stage__splash" d=""></path><text x="50" y="309" text-anchor="end">Share</text></a>
<a class="loop-stage" href="#stage-reuse" data-tip="Agents. I decide: When a task has repeated enough to become a skill or plugin." aria-label="Reuse, agents: When a task has repeated enough to become a skill or plugin. Go to the Reuse stage."><path class="loop-stage__splash" d=""></path><text x="118" y="122" text-anchor="end">Reuse</text></a>
</g>
<g style="font-family: var(--font-hand)" text-anchor="middle">
<text x="300" y="292" fill="var(--accent)" style="font-size: 58px; font-weight: 600">Human</text>
<text x="300" y="334" fill="var(--text-muted)" style="font-size: 30px; font-weight: 500">in the loop</text>
</g>
<path d="M 246 352 C 270 362, 330 362, 356 350" fill="none" stroke="var(--text-muted)" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
</svg>
<p class="loop-tip" role="tooltip" id="loop-tip" hidden data-loop-tip></p>
<ul class="loop-legend" aria-label="Legend">
<li><span class="loop-legend__agent" aria-hidden="true"></span>Agents</li>
<li><span class="loop-legend__human" aria-hidden="true"></span>Human</li>
</ul>
</figure>
<div style="flex: 1 1 340px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px">
<h2 id="loop-title" style="margin: 0; color: var(--accent); font-size: clamp(34px, 4vw, 48px); font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.1">One loop, eight stages, four gates.</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; text-wrap: pretty">Agents do the work at every stage: they research, draft, design, code, check and package. The loop only moves past a gate when I've looked at the result and said yes.</p>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted)">Reuse closes the loop: anything I do twice becomes a skill or a plugin, and the next project starts faster.</p>
</div>
</section>

